{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51194","headline":"五言白话诗 一 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"村头语户主，乡头无处得。\n在县用纸多，从吾相便贷。\n我命自贫穷，独辨不可得。\n（「辨」，张锡厚改作「辧」。\n）合村看我面，此度必须得。\n後衙空手去，定是搦你勒。\n（「搦」，斯五四四一卷作「独」，据张锡厚改。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51194.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51194","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}